<p>You've been invited to create an account on the Cain &amp; Co. site.</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Accept your invitation", @accept_url %>
</p>

<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px;">
  If the link doesn't work, copy and paste this into your browser:<br>
  <%= @accept_url %>
</p>

<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px;">
  This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Invitation::EXPIRES_IN) %>. If you weren't
